# Bit Manipulation


## Problems (easy to hard)

Work top to bottom. Each level adds one new idea on top of the last.

### Level 1 - Single-bit operations
Idea: check / set / clear the i-th bit; n & (n-1) clears the lowest set bit.

LeetCode 191.     Number of 1 Bits
LeetCode 231.     Power of Two
LeetCode 342.     Power of Four
LeetCode 461.     Hamming Distance
LeetCode 476.     Number Complement
LeetCode 338.     Counting Bits

### Level 2 - XOR tricks
Idea: a ^ a = 0 and a ^ 0 = a.

LeetCode 136.     Single Number  - DONE
LeetCode 268.     Missing Number  - DONE
LeetCode 190.     Reverse Bits
LeetCode 371.     Sum of Two Integers                             -- add without +

### Level 3 - Counting bits and masks
LeetCode 260.     Single Number III
LeetCode 137.     Single Number II                                -- count bits mod 3
LeetCode 201.     Bitwise AND of Numbers Range                    -- common prefix
LeetCode 78.      Subsets                                         -- bitmask enumeration
LeetCode 1863.    Sum of All Subset XOR Totals
LeetCode 393.     UTF-8 Validation

### Level 4 - Hard
LeetCode 421.     Maximum XOR of Two Numbers in an Array          -- bitwise trie
LeetCode 1318.    Minimum Flips to Make a OR b Equal to c
